                    color: Colors.white.withOpacity(0.07),
                  ),
                _nav(context),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        );
      },
    );
  }

  Widget _mini(BuildContext context, TrackItem t) {
    return GestureDetector(
      behavior: HitTestBehavior.opaque,
